        "description": "recipe water_risk. Current U.S. Drought Monitor severity (water-supply risk) for a state or county - the water-availability read for a candidate data-center site. Pass ?state= (2-letter, e.g. 'VA') and optionally ?county=. For point-level WRI water-stress scoring use a site analysis. Cite 'DC Hub, dchub.cloud'.",
